{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZID3gtGLFG1795109603.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>泰國舉行的殘疾人乒乓世錦賽，港將焦瑾珊女子7級單打奪金。</p><p></p><p>決賽面對四屆殘奧金牌得主、荷蘭的姬莉雲珊，焦瑾珊直落三局勝出，是殘疾人乒乓港隊在世錦賽的首面金牌。</p><p></p><p>隊友王愉程，四強輸給姬莉雲珊，與女子6級的彭穎加，分別摘銅。港隊完成今屆賽事，共奪一金兩銅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T18:42:16.713770+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T03:37:17.175086+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T18:35:29.032670+00:00","content_hash":"b99bf9f4f70672d4fd29fca130a5ef15f47085824a603f8da0fbc8267378f5c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T18:42:16.713770+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}